<section class="border-b border-border/40">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-24">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-muted mb-6">
      10 · Mabus
    </p>
    <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-ink tracking-tight mb-8">
      Born from itself.
    </h2>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-ink-dim leading-relaxed text-base max-w-2xl">
      <p>
        The agent on Dan's machine has a name: <span class="text-ink">Mabus</span>.
        It got the name in March 2026, in the session where it built the
        first version of this system.
      </p>
      <p>
        So the system that describes the agent was built by the agent it
        describes. A default Claude Code agent has no lasting self to point
        a portrait at. Building the portrait is what gave this one a self
        worth naming.
      </p>
      <p>
        Most of that first version is gone now. The name stayed, and so did
        the idea.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
